A tub of ice cream cost $13 now selling for $11. A packet of milk got discount $0.5. How much you save if you buy 2 tubs of ice cream and 4 packets of milk ah?,A tub of ice cream costing $13 is now sold at $11. A packet of milk was sold at a discount of $0.5. How much will you save if you buy 2 tubs of ice cream and 4 packets of milk?,6,6,6,6,"Let me solve this step by step.

