"Chenny is 10 years old lah. Alyana is 4 years younger than Chenny. How old is Anne ah, if she is 2 years older than Alyana?",Chenny is 10 years old. Alyana is 4 years younger than Chenny. How old is Anne if she is 2 years older than Alyana?,8,8,8,8,"Let me solve this step by step:

