"A bag of flour kena split into 8 parts, each part 2 kilograms. How many kilograms of flour was there in three bags total, before they split it up?","A bag of flour is divided into 8 portions of 2 kilograms each. How much flour (in kilograms) was in three bags in total, before it was divided into portions?",48,48,48,48,"Let me solve this step by step.

