"Andrew bake 200 mini cinnamon rolls and 300 mini blueberry muffins lah. A normal cinnamon roll got 600 calories and a normal blueberry muffin got 450 calories. If a mini pastry got 1/3rd the calories of the normal one, how many calories all the pastries he bake have ah?","Andrew bakes 200 mini cinnamon rolls and 300 mini blueberry muffins. A normal cinnamon roll has 600 calories and a normal blueberry muffin has 450 calories. If a mini pastry has 1/3rd of the calories of a normal version, how many calories do the pastries he baked have?",85000,85000,850,850,"Let me solve this step by step.

