"Zeke's baseball team got 7 more players than Carlton's one. If Carlton's team got 13 players, how many players they all got together?","Zeke's baseball team has 7 more players than Carlton's. If Carlton's team has 13 players, how many players are there in both teams combined?",33,33,33,33,"Let me solve this step by step.

