"Apple High School siah, this year graduation at their Fine Arts Center lor, can fit 6000 people one. After chope 950 seats for the graduates and 300 seats for the teachers hor, how many tickets each graduate can get to give their kakis and family if share share equally?","Apple High School is holding graduation in their Fine Arts Center this year which has space for 6000 people. After accounting for 950 seats for graduates and 300 seats for faculty attending, how many tickets would each graduate receive to give to their friends and family if the tickets are split equally?",5,5,5,5,"Let me solve this step by step.

