"My kitchen floor got total area 200 SqFt lah. I wanna put new square floor tiles, each one cost $12, and each tile side is 1ft long. How much it gonna cost me to redo my kitchen floor?","My kitchen floor has a total area of 200 SqFt. I want to install new square floor tiles that cost $12 each, and each tile side is 1ft in length. How much will it cost me to renovate my kitchen floor?",2400,2400,240,240,"Let me solve this step by step.

