"Aaron and Vanessa were relay race kakis in a running team. Aaron could run each mile dua kali faster than Vanessa, but Vanessa could run dua kali further than Aaron. If Vanessa ran 4 miles and Aaron finished his part of the race in 16 minutes, how long in minutes did Vanessa take to finish her part?","Aaron and Vanessa were relay race partners on a running team. Aaron was able to run each mile twice as fast as Vanessa, but Vanessa was able to run twice as far as Aaron did. If Vanessa ran 4 miles and Aaron completed his part of the race in 16 minutes, how long in minutes did Vanessa take to complete her part?",64,64,64,64,"Let me solve this step by step.

1) Let's identify the key information:
   * Aaron runs each mile 2× faster than Vanessa
   * Vanessa can run 2× further than Aaron
   * Vanessa ran 4 miles
